translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c1f1362c:

    # "The Captain smirked as he kicked some of the hay aside and revealed a magic circle concealed beneath."
    "Der Kapitän grinste, als er etwas Heu beiseite trat und einen darunter verborgenen magischen Kreis enthüllte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:270
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_a51105ae:

    # "The crowd murmured, half in awe, half in surprise."
    "Die Menge murmelte, halb ehrfürchtig, halb überrascht."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:271
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_efda234b:

    # DUPREY "Like I said, girl, here, we don’t teach the fancy stuff."
    DUPREY "Wie ich schon sagte, Mädchen, hier lehren wir nicht den Schnickschnack."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:272
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c762f908:

    # DUPREY "We teach you how to win. No matter what."
    DUPREY "Wir bringen dir bei, wie du gewinnst. Egal was passiert."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:273
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_c59322b4:

    # "The crowd applauded and cheered as the girl smiled sheepishly."
    "Die Menge applaudierte und jubelte, während das Mädchen verlegen lächelte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:275
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05014119:

    # "When she got off the podium, she was welcomed back by the others who all patted her on the back for a fight well fought."
    "Als sie vom Podium stieg, wurde sie von den anderen wieder willkommen geheißen, die ihr alle auf die Schulter klopften für einen gut geführten Kampf."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:277
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_3e8845e2:

    # DUPREY "Alright everyone!"
    DUPREY "Also gut, Leute!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:278
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_53cb2fa8:

    # DUPREY "It's a start alright, but we still have a lot of work ahead of us!"
    DUPREY "Es ist ein Anfang, okay, aber es liegt noch viel Arbeit vor uns."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:279
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_05bea46f:

    # DUPREY "Now, go and take some rest."
    DUPREY "Und jetzt geht und ruht euch etwas aus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:281
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_df74a53c:

    # DUPREY "By the time the sun hits these training dummies, I expect you lot here again!"
    DUPREY "Sobald die Sonne auf diese Trainingspuppen scheint, will ich euch alle wieder hier sehen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:282
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_AtTrainingYard_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Wegtreten!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:300
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_0bd9b2e5:

    # DUPREY "It stands to reason, you maggots."
    DUPREY "Das liegt auf der Hand, ihr Maden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:301
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_c6b5eac0:

    # DUPREY "That to {i}kill{/i} the enemy, you must first strike him."
    DUPREY "Dass man den Feind, um ihn zu {i}töten{/i}, zuerst angreifen muss."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:302
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_75af9096:

    # DUPREY "You cannot hesitate with your blade, not even for a second."
    DUPREY "Ihr könnt mit eurer Klinge nicht zögern, nicht einmal für eine Sekunde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:303
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_56b25b16:

    # DUPREY "The Demorai will spare you no quarter."
    DUPREY "Die Demorai werden euch keine Gnade gewähren."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:304
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_94c5eb63:

    # DUPREY "They know no fear."
    DUPREY "Sie kennen keine Furcht."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:305
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_87825edf:

    # DUPREY "Hesitation does not exist in the minds of the enemy you will face."
    DUPREY "Zögern existiert nicht in den Köpfen des Feindes, dem ihr gegenüberstehen werdet."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:306
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_2ae3da65:

    # DUPREY "They will not stop, they will keep coming until {i}you{/i} are dead."
    DUPREY "Sie werden nicht aufhören, sie werden weitermachen, bis {i}ihr{/i} tot seid."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:307
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_a1a19941:

    # DUPREY "...So {i}you{/i} will not stop, {i}you{/i} will know no hesitation either."
    DUPREY "... Also werdet {i}ihr{/i} nicht aufhören, {i}ihr{/i} werdet auch kein Zögern kennen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:308
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_9ef65af9:

    # DUPREY "{i}You{/i} will make them kiss the blades you carry and grant them the death they so crave!"
    DUPREY "{i}Ihr{/i} werdet sie die Klingen, die ihr tragt, küssen lassen und ihnen den Tod gewähren, nach dem sie sich so sehr sehnen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:309
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_931fd1a0:

    # "There was some cheering, whistles and claps from the recruits, but Captain Duprey remained stoically the same."
    "Es gab Jubel, Pfiffe und Klatschen von den Rekruten, aber Captain Duprey blieb stoisch unverändert."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:310
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_3c541189:

    # DUPREY "When you strike at an enemy, if you're too slow they may dodge or block the strike."
    DUPREY "Wenn du einen Feind angreifst, und du zu langsam bist, kann er dem Schlag ausweichen oder ihn abblocken."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:311
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_935e6dba:

    # DUPREY "Get used to that feeling of metal clashing, you lose your blade out in the field, {i}you're finished.{/i}"
    DUPREY "Gewöhne dich an das Gefühl von aufeinanderprallendem Metall, verlierst du deine Klinge draußen im Feld, {i}bist du erledigt.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:312
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_bba80207:

    # DUPREY "Now grab someone to spar with."
    DUPREY "Jetzt such dir jemanden zum Üben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:313
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...BEGINN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:332
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7a71149d:

    # MARKUS "That was... good."
    MARKUS "Das war... gut."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:333
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b31d8f4f:

    # "Markus caught his breath and asked:"
    "Markus rang nach Luft und fragte:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:334
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_34c43e8a:

    # MARKUS "Say, wanna go again?"
    MARKUS "Sag mal, wollen wir nochmal?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:336
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_5d179d76:

    # MARKUS "You could do better, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "Du könntest das besser machen, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:337
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_732df93f:

    # "Markus looked around and figured we could go for another round."
    "Markus sah sich um und meinte, wir könnten noch eine Runde machen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:338
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6c053eec:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again, shall we?"
    MARKUS "Gehen wir nochmal, einverstanden?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:341
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b09806db:

    # MARKUS "That's my [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "Das ist mein [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:342
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_c9b50785:

    # MARKUS "Let's learn to handle these sticks of ours proper..."
    MARKUS "Lass uns lernen, mit unseren Stöcken hier richtig umzugehen…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:343
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f9bd7eb4:

    # MC "Sticks of ours? Wha~"
    MC "Unseren Stöcken? Wa~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:344
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_982720f4:

    # MARKUS "Defend yourself!"
    MARKUS "Verteidige dich!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:349
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_73fd8781:

    # MARKUS "Fair enough."
    MARKUS "In Ordnung."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:355
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_85180b52:

    # "We have spent the remainder of the day practicing more basic combat moves."
    "Wir haben den Rest des Tages damit verbracht, weitere grundlegende Kampfbewegungen zu üben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:357
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_950ca5f4:

    # "Exhausted, I made my way back towards the barracks."
    "Erschöpft machte ich mich auf den Weg zurück zur Kaserne."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:362
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b623e6ef:

    # "Entering the barracks, I was whistled over by a towering warrior I have seen a couple times before in the fort."
    "Als ich die Kaserne betrat, wurde ich von einem hochgewachsenen Krieger herbeigepfiffen, den ich schon ein paar Mal in der Festung gesehen hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:365
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_6adb8189:

    # OFFICER @ talk "[player_name!t], isn't it?"
    OFFICER @ talk "[player_name!t], nicht wahr?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:367
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_942cd646:

    # MC @ talk "Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "Ja, Sir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:368
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9493a3e8:

    # OFFICER @ talk "I am First Officer Borras, Captain Duprey's second in command."
    OFFICER @ talk "Ich bin Erster Offizier Borras, Captain Dupreys Stellvertreter."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:369
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f902ebfc:

    # "I gulped as my body straightened and stiffened on its own."
    "Ich schluckte schwer, als mein Körper sich von selbst aufrichtete und versteifte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:370
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_b1f42af4:

    # MC @ talk "S-sir?"
    MC @ talk "S-Sir?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:371
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3936d95e:

    # BORRAS @ talk "You're on cleaning duty tonight."
    BORRAS @ talk "Du hast heute Abend Putzdienst."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:373
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_8629b4ea:

    # MC @ talk "(Arrgh! Come on now!)"
    MC @ talk "(Arrgh! Komm schon!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:375
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_9a2d9435:

    # MC @ talk "...Yes sir."
    MC @ talk "...Ja, Sir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:378
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_f4f3ec57:

    # "I spent the next hour or so mopping, polishing and cleaning the barracks from top to bottom."
    "Die nächste Stunde oder so verbrachte ich damit, die Kaserne von oben bis unten zu schrubben, zu polieren und zu putzen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:380
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_00514271:

    # "Finally, I found myself finished."
    "Endlich war ich fertig."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:381
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4f1e169:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    MC "{i}*Seufz*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:382
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_278d91ab:

    # MC "(All that's left to do is clean the wash area.)"
    MC "(Jetzt muss nur noch der Waschraum gereinigt werden.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:383
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_57878b2a:

    # "As I headed in, I heard what sounded like... splashing?"
    "Als ich hineinging, hörte ich etwas, das wie... Platschen klang?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:384
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_68fec10d:

    # "At this hour?"
    "Um diese Uhrzeit?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:385
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_554aa8aa:

    # "Realizing the splashing was coming from the woman's side, I pondered what to do..."
    "Als mir klar wurde, dass das Platschen von der Frauenseite kam, überlegte ich, was ich tun sollte..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:390
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3b428651:

    # "It had felt like forever since I last got the chance to see a woman naked."
    "Es kam mir wie eine Ewigkeit vor, seit ich das letzte Mal die Gelegenheit hatte, eine nackte Frau zu sehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:391
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_bfd776ce:

    # "The temptation was too much to bear, and, letting my curiosity get the best of me, I peeked around the woman's side to take a look."
    "Die Versuchung war zu groß, und von meiner Neugier übermannt, spähte ich um die Ecke der Frauenseite, um einen Blick zu erhaschen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:393
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_adf06afd:

    # "Kiara was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "Kiara hockte nackt da und wusch sich mit einem nassen Waschlappen und einem Eimer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:394
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a4806da6:

    # KIARA "So, are you just going to stand there and watch?"
    KIARA "Also, wirst du einfach da stehen und zusehen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:395
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3d654567:

    # MC @ scared "K-Kiara!"
    MC @ scared "K-Kiara!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:396
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2df5f315:

    # "Realizing I'd been caught, Kiara, grabbing a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "Als Kiara merkte, dass ich erwischt worden war, griff sie nach einem Handtuch, wickelte es sich um und marschierte mit verschränkten Armen auf mich zu."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:397
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_a50ae3ab:

    # MC @ scared "It... It isn't what it looked like?"
    MC @ scared "Es... Es ist nicht so, wie es aussah?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:399
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1ca6c786:

    # "That scout girl I've seen around was squatted down naked, washing herself with a wet flannel and bucket."
    "Das Pfadfindermädchen, das ich hier gesehen habe, hockte nackt und wusch sich mit einem nassen Lappen und einem Eimer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:400
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_edca490d:

    # KIARA "Kiara. Pleasure meeting you."
    KIARA "Kiara. Freut mich, dich kennenzulernen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:404
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_2bbabbd5:

    # MC @ scared "Wh-what..."
    MC @ scared "Wa-was..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:405
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_04b16aef:

    # "As I realized I was caught, I shot words at her in an apologetic burst:"
    "Als ich merkte, dass ich erwischt wurde, sprudelte ich entschuldigende Worte hervor:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:406
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_3e3db114:

    # MC "[player_name!t], pleasure's all mine, I'm sorry I was~"
    MC "[player_name!t], die Freude ist ganz meinerseits, es tut mir leid, ich war gerade~"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:407
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_478fa33b:

    # "Kiara grabbed a towel, wrapped it around herself as she marched over towards me, arms folded."
    "Kiara schnappte sich ein Handtuch, wickelte es sich um, während sie mit verschränkten Armen auf mich zumarschierte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:414
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_cfb43425:

    # KIARA @ angry "So you {i}weren't{/i} just spying on me then?"
    KIARA @ angry "Du hast mir also {i}nicht{/i} nur nachspioniert, oder?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:415
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_77f8c828:

    # MC "N-No, I came here to clean the wash rooms, I swear it so!"
    MC "N-Nein, ich bin hergekommen, um die Waschräume zu reinigen, ich schwöre es!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:416
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_d56beb53:

    # "Kiara's stern expression softened as she laughed."
    "Kiaras strenge Miene wurde weicher, als sie lachte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:417
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_812bd8c8:

    # KIARA @ happy "Haha, relax."
    KIARA @ happy "Haha, entspann dich."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:418
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_800b5920:

    # KIARA "I'm just playing with you."
    KIARA "Ich spiele nur mit dir."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:419
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_4eb41718:

    # "Kiara winked."
    "Kiara zwinkerte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:420
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_1365d248:

    # KIARA "You can take a look anytime you want, cutie."
    KIARA "Du kannst jederzeit einen Blick darauf werfen, wenn du willst, Süßer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:421
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7ebb922b:

    # MC "I - {i}*Cough*{/i}"
    MC "Ich - {i}*Hust*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:422
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_80e56fde:

    # MC @ talk "What are you doing here?"
    MC @ talk "Was machst du hier?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:423
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training0FirstFight_repBattle_7ac5c305:

