translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_dbbfb15d:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Remember, 'special moves like these can be the difference between life and death'!"
    MARKUS @ smile "Denk dran: 'Spezialtechniken wie diese können über Leben und Tod entscheiden'!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:568
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1d019d6b:

    # "Markus smiled as he perfectly quoted Duprey."
    "Markus lächelte, als er Duprey perfekt zitierte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:569
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_4baaa790:

    # MC "Okay, I'll kick your ass now, {i}captain{/i}."
    MC "Okay, jetzt mache ich dich fertig, {i}captain{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:570
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_397f9c31:

    # MARKUS "On guard!"
    MARKUS "Aufgepasst!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:575
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "Also gut."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:576
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_40b12a4d:

    # MARKUS "It was kinda cool though, wasn't it?"
    MARKUS "Es war aber schon irgendwie cool, oder?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:577
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_eb54f1a5:

    # MC "Yeah, beats swinging it against these training dummies!"
    MC "Ja, besser als es gegen diese Trainingspuppen zu schwingen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:585
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ba3a1381:

    # "For the remainder of the day, Duprey educated us on the nuances of using various special skills, tools and items in battle."
    "Für den Rest des Tages unterrichtete uns Duprey in den Feinheiten des Einsatzes verschiedener Spezialfähigkeiten, Werkzeuge und Gegenstände im Kampf."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:586
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d61d0b14:

    # "Exhausted, I didn't really get much of it: magic refraction scrolls, ensnarement crystals, Vulshan smoke bombs..."
    "Erschöpft, wie ich war, habe ich nicht viel davon mitbekommen: Magie-Refraktionsrollen, Verstrickungskristalle, Vulshan-Rauchbomben..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:587
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_3a645881:

    # "Come dusk, Duprey concluded with showing us some advanced combat moves, I guess to somehow inspire us to master the art of combat."
    "Bei Einbruch der Dämmerung schloss Duprey damit ab, uns einige fortgeschrittene Kampfbewegungen zu zeigen, wohl um uns irgendwie zu inspirieren, die Kunst des Kampfes zu meistern."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:592
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ca79f8f3:

    # DUPREY "...So this is how you do the Waltzing Bazark strike."
    DUPREY "...Also so macht man den Waltzing Bazark-Schlag."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:593
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7f316660:

    # "Duprey caught his breath after executing a rather spectacular combat move."
    "Duprey holte Atem, nachdem er eine ziemlich spektakuläre Kampfbewegung ausgeführt hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:594
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_55a1cf16:

    # "He scanned the crowd of recruits, totally exhausted from another training session, and I can promise I saw a hint of fatherly smile on his face."
    "Er musterte die Menge der Rekruten, völlig erschöpft von einer weiteren Trainingseinheit, und ich kann versprechen, dass ich einen Anflug eines väterlichen Lächelns auf seinem Gesicht sah."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:595
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_56df01de:

    # DUPREY "Okay, you lot."
    DUPREY "Okay, ihr Haufen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:596
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_60e9fa7e:

    # DUPREY "Go and take some rest now."
    DUPREY "Geh und ruh dich jetzt etwas aus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:602
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_c70200c9:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other in confusion:"
    "Ich und Markus sahen uns verwirrt an:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:603
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_b1a7928d:

    # MC "A Waltzing Bazark? I'm not even trying something like that."
    MC "Ein walzender Basar? So etwas probiere ich gar nicht erst."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:604
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_99873a35:

    # MARKUS "You'd be collecting me from all over the yard if I did..."
    MARKUS "Du müsstest mich vom ganzen Hof aufsammeln, wenn ich das täte..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:647
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a3accbf:

    # REGINA "...[player_name!t]."
    REGINA "...[player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:648
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_7199e905:

    # REGINA "Wake up, [player_name!t]."
    REGINA "Wach auf, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:652
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a66cc92:

    # "As my eyes slowly peeled open, a dark, raven haired blob was stood, lurched over the side of my bed."
    "Als sich meine Augen langsam öffneten, stand ein dunkler, rabenschwarzer Schemen gebeugt über der Bettkante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:653
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_c40f7ba2:

    # "My vision became clearer: there I saw, clear as day, [regina_ref!t] crouched over and smiling towards me."
    "Meine Sicht wurde klarer: da sah ich, klar wie der Tag, [regina_ref!t] hingekauert und mich anlächelnd."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:654
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_0bbec91f:

    # MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"
    MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:655
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3fe750ff:

    # "[regina_ref_cap!t] placed her finger over her lip and motioned for me to be silent."
    "[regina_ref_cap!t] legte ihren Finger auf ihre Lippe und bedeutete mir, still zu sein."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:656
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_87f8b481:

    # "{i}Was this some kind of a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}War das eine Art Traum?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:657
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_9ce974a4:

    # "She leaned in close to whisper."
    "Sie beugte sich nah heran, um zu flüstern."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:658
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_32cf642b:

    # REGINA @ smile "I've bought you some things, dear."
    REGINA @ smile "Ich habe dir ein paar Sachen gekauft, Liebes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:659
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_6f52509f:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}Just a little something between the two of us...{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "{i}Nur eine Kleinigkeit zwischen uns beiden...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:660
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caa43851:

    # MC @ surprised "How ... How did you even get in here?"
    MC @ surprised "Wie ... Wie bist du überhaupt hier reingekommen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:661
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_257c75a7:

    # REGINA @ talk "Don't worry about that now, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "Mach dir darüber jetzt keine Sorgen, Liebes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:662
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_eb2e578c:

    # REGINA @ talk "I just wanted to see you."
    REGINA @ talk "Ich wollte dich einfach nur sehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:663
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_fb531ee6:

    # MC @ talk "But-"
    MC @ talk "Aber-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:664
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24a60a73:

    # "As her hand gently caressed my cheek, I began to feel myself drifting back to the darkness once again."
    "Als ihre Hand sanft meine Wange streichelte, spürte ich, wie ich wieder in die Dunkelheit hinüberglitt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:666
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4ff52e4f:

    # "{i}Perhaps, this really was a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}Vielleicht war das wirklich ein Traum?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:667
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_ccaef93c:

    # REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Sleep, dear.{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Schlaf, Liebes.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:668
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_898758b8:

    # REGINA "{i}I'll always be here for you...{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}Ich werde immer für dich da sein...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:669
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3b1abd21:

    # REGINA "{i}...no matter what.{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}...egal was passiert.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:693
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caba15b5:

    # "Springing upright in my bed, soaked in sweat, I looked around as people prepared themselves for another day of training."
    "Ich setzte mich kerzengerade im Bett auf, schweißgebadet, und sah mich um, während die Leute sich auf einen weiteren Trainingstag vorbereiteten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:696
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4f0b95e9:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Are you alright?"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Geht es dir gut?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:697
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24f0136a:

    # MC @ scared "I ... I think so."
    MC @ scared "Ich ... ich glaube schon."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:698
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_328b83d2:

    # MARKUS "Bad dreams?"
    MARKUS "Schlechte Träume?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:700
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_b260c7ad:

    # MC @ scared "...I'm not sure what it was."
    MC @ scared "...Ich bin mir nicht sicher, was es war."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:701
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5d45ce3:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Well, you look like you've seen a ghost!"
    MARKUS @ shock "Nun, du siehst aus, als hättest du einen Geist gesehen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:702
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5193f8a:

    # "Somehow, a ghost felt more explainable than what I saw last night..."
    "Irgendwie kam mir ein Geist erklärbarer vor als das, was ich letzte Nacht sah..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:703
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_247c26f4:

    # MARKUS "Come, I'm sure a few whacks from a training sword will take your mind off whatever it was!"
    MARKUS "Komm, ich bin sicher, ein paar Schläge mit einem Übungsschwert werden dich von dem ablenken, was auch immer es war!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:706
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_a8954217:

    # "As Markus headed out of the barracks towards the training yard, I shook my head, pushing the strange dream aside."
    "Als Markus aus der Kaserne in Richtung Übungsplatz ging, schüttelte ich den Kopf und schob den seltsamen Traum beiseite."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:708
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_83da7088:

    # "Opening my chest to grab my uniform, I noticed immediately the strangely placed bottle of red wine that wasn't there before..."
    "Als ich meine Truhe öffnete, um meine Uniform zu holen, bemerkte ich sofort die seltsam platzierte Flasche Rotwein, die vorher nicht da war..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:710
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_01b21009:

    # MC @ scared "(It... It was a dream!)"
    MC @ scared "(Es... Es war ein Traum!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:713
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d62002c2:

    # MC @ think "(...Right?)"
    MC @ think "(...Oder?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:725
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f1834407:

    # DUPREY "...So, having being around a little, what do you lot think matters the most in battle?"
    DUPREY "...Also, nachdem ihr schon ein bisschen dabei seid, was glaubt ihr, zählt im Kampf am meisten?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:726
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_84edc41c:

    # "We looked at each other puzzled."
    "Wir sahen uns verwirrt an."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:728
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_cef8185e:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Strength?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Stärke?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:729
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6cf01769:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Our gear!{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Unsere Ausrüstung!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:730
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_5b70b478:

    # "Some of us were throwing more words out there, until..."
    "Einige von uns warfen noch mehr Worte ein, bis..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:731
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_59efef91:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Being like... a single force?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Wie ... eine einzige Kraft?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:732
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_60c375e0:

    # "I swear I saw a hint of suprise on Duprey's face:"
    "Ich schwöre, ich sah einen Hauch von Überraschung auf Dupreys Gesicht:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:733
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_a52d9426:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Right on, lad!"
    DUPREY @ laugh "Genau so, Junge!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:734
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ae81de48:

    # "Silence covered our ranks, as we have began to realize what today's lesson was about."
    "Schweigen senkte sich über unsere Reihen, als wir zu begreifen begannen, worum es in der heutigen Lektion ging."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:735
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_c6bbed4f:

    # "Duprey smiled for a moment as he continued:"
    "Duprey lächelte einen Moment lang, während er fortfuhr:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:736
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f6068bdd:

    # DUPREY "Teamwork, lads."
    DUPREY "Teamarbeit, Jungs."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:737
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2c171579:

    # DUPREY "Confidence in a soldier to your left and a soldier to your right, {i}this{/i} is the driving force behind any worthy army."
    DUPREY "Vertrauen in den Soldaten zu deiner Linken und den Soldaten zu deiner Rechten, {i}das{/i} ist die treibende Kraft hinter jeder würdigen Armee."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:738
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_479fffc2:

    # "Duprey began pointing at recruits from the crowd:"
    "Duprey begann, auf Rekruten aus der Menge zu zeigen:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:739
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_54599814:

    # DUPREY "You can have the best gear in all Alderay!"
    DUPREY "Du kannst die beste Ausrüstung in ganz Alderay haben!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:740
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fae39187:

    # DUPREY "And you can be an expert at handling your weapon of choice,"
    DUPREY "Und du kannst ein Experte im Umgang mit deiner bevorzugten Waffe sein,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:741
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_812a5810:

    # DUPREY "While your bag of dirty tricks can grow as large as to become a caravan,"
    DUPREY "Während dein Repertoire an schmutzigen Tricks so groß werden kann wie eine Karawane,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:742
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_671d40a2:

    # "Some recruits laughed as Duprey continued, ever more serious:"
    "Einige Rekruten lachten, als Duprey immer ernster fortfuhr:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:743
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2ff1717a:

    # DUPREY "But if you don't have a warrior, a true battle brother you are dead sure in at your side,"
    DUPREY "Aber wenn du keinen Krieger hast, einen wahren Kampfbruder, auf den du dich absolut verlassen kannst, an deiner Seite,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:744
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ff502967:

    # DUPREY "One who would stand with you no matter what is coming at you..."
    DUPREY "Einer, der zu dir stehen würde, egal was auf dich zukommt..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:745
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_95d64e38:

    # "Duprey's expression turned pale for a moment, as if his mind's eye erupted with memories."
    "Dupreys Gesichtsausdruck wurde für einen Moment blass, als ob sein geistiges Auge von Erinnerungen überflutet wurde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:746
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fa17f4b8:

    # DUPREY "You {i}will be{/i} obliterated."
    DUPREY "Du {i}wirst{/i} ausgelöscht werden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:747
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_828b281f:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other and nodded stoically, but Duprey's usual commanding tone snapped us out of it quick:"
    "Markus und ich sahen uns an und nickten stoisch, aber Dupreys gewohnt befehlender Ton riss uns schnell daraus:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:748
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_b5b6ec4e:

    # DUPREY "None of us would want that to happen, right you maggots?!"
    DUPREY "Das will keiner von uns erleben, nicht wahr, ihr Maden?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:750
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_41a3cf71:

    # DUPREY "Today, you will spar in teams of two!"
    DUPREY "Heute werdet ihr in Zweierteams kämpfen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:751
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_dfb15ac9:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, and get to it!"
    DUPREY "Bildet Partner und macht euch an die Arbeit!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:752
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...LOS!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:776
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_22336bc1:

    # MARKUS "Phew... You guys kicked our ass!"
    MARKUS "Puh... Ihr habt uns ja ordentlich vermöbelt!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:777
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d5403c39:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again now!"
    MARKUS "Jetzt geht's wieder los!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:778
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d4066694:

    # MARKUS "I swear you won't get us this time!"
    MARKUS "Ich schwöre, diesmal kriegt ihr uns nicht!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:780
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4303ca27:

    # "Markus and his teammate both looked at us two."
    "Markus und sein Teamkollege sahen uns beide an."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:781
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4c68b6fe:

    # MARKUS "Come on guys, remember what Duprey said!"
    MARKUS "Kommt schon, Jungs, denkt dran, was Duprey gesagt hat!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:782
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_072ed379:

    # MARKUS "Be a single force!"
    MARKUS "Seid eine Einheit!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:783
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_7e6c58ca:

    # "His teammate interrupted:"
    "Sein Teamkollege unterbrach:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:785
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_c87c6273:

    # RECRUIT "Actually... it was me who said it..."
    RECRUIT "Eigentlich... war ich es, der das gesagt hat..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:786
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_76d4b651:

    # "I let out a laugh which echoed painfully all over my body."
    "Ich stieß ein Lachen aus, das schmerzhaft durch meinen ganzen Körper hallte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:787
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_33a51547:

    # MARKUS "... Whatever! Come on, let's go for another round!"
    MARKUS "... Egal! Komm, lass uns noch eine Runde machen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:790
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_2af51c90:

    # MARKUS "That's what I like to hear!"
    MARKUS "Das höre ich gern!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:791
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_102beb74:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Let's see if our 'army' defeats yours this time!"
    MARKUS @ smile "Mal sehen, ob unsere 'Armee' eure diesmal besiegt!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:795
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "Na gut."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:796
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1506ca74:

    # MARKUS "I've sprained my ankle anyways..."
    MARKUS "Ich habe mir sowieso den Knöchel verstaucht..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:799
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_3c091867:

    # "The rest of the day we have spent learning more nuances about working together as a combat unit."
    "Den Rest des Tages haben wir damit verbracht, mehr Nuancen über die Zusammenarbeit als Kampfeinheit zu lernen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:800
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1da7d2b2:

    # "As we have come to realize the importance of teamwork in practice, Duprey's initial statement of it being the crucial aspect of warfare became clear as day."
    "Als wir die Bedeutung von Teamwork in der Praxis erkannt hatten, wurde Dupreys anfängliche Aussage, dass es der entscheidende Aspekt der Kriegsführung ist, glasklar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:801
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_73c0dac8:

    # "We had to {i}become{/i} the Second Scouts Division."
    "Wir mussten die Zweite Scouts-Division {i}werden{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:806
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5d262372:

    # DUPREY "...So, that will be it for today, Scouts."
    DUPREY "... So, das wäre es für heute, Scouts."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:807
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_b8c44b07:

    # DUPREY "And one more thing..."
    DUPREY "Und noch etwas..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:808
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_f2c412ef:

    # DUPREY "We can't be training in this cage forever,"
    DUPREY "Wir können nicht für immer in diesem Käfig trainieren,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:809
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_fc3f4089:

    # "Duprey waved at the walls,"
    "Duprey winkte zu den Wänden,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:810
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5bc59c1b:

    # DUPREY "But before we begin any real training maneuvers, I need to see just how much you lot had learned since you've got here."
    DUPREY "Aber bevor wir mit echten Trainingsmanövern beginnen, muss ich sehen, wie viel ihr Haufen gelernt hat, seit ihr hier seid."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:811
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_37c4720a:

    # DUPREY "Hit that bunk hard for there will be a test tomorrow!"
    DUPREY "Haut euch ordentlich aufs Ohr, denn morgen gibt's einen Test!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:812
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Wegtreten!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:817
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_70c270b5:

    # "Me and Markus exchanged looks."
    "Markus und ich tauschten Blicke."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:818
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5dbd6a38:

    # MARKUS "A test, huh?"
    MARKUS "Ein Test, was?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:819
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_0da95cfe:

    # MC "Whatever it is, let's go get some sleep."
    MC "Was auch immer es ist, lass uns schlafen gehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:836
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6d3b7e65:

    # "In the dead of night, I was restless."
    "Mitten in der Nacht war ich unruhig."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:841
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8c266e01:

    # "Opening my eyes, I sat-upright in my bunk and looked around."
    "Ich öffnete die Augen, setzte mich in meiner Koje auf und sah mich um."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:843
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccd5a8ea:

    # "Everyone around me was deep in sleep still, including Markus."
    "Alle um mich herum schliefen noch tief, einschließlich Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:844
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_03bec688:

    # "I sighed, rubbing my forehead as I climbed out of bed."
    "Ich seufzte und rieb mir die Stirn, als ich aus dem Bett stieg."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:845
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b9564fe7:

    # "{i}Just a short walk around the fort grounds{/i} I told myself..."
    "{i}Nur ein kurzer Spaziergang über das Festungsgelände{/i}, sagte ich mir ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:846
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af74cbd2:

    # "I'll be back before anyone even realizes I'm gone."
    "Ich werde zurück sein, bevor jemand bemerkt, dass ich weg bin."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:853
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59eaf8b8:

    # "As the cold night air hit my lungs, I thought about heading back inside before I heard Captain Duprey's voice."
    "Als die kalte Nachtluft meine Lungen traf, dachte ich darüber nach, wieder hineinzugehen, bevor ich Captain Dupreys Stimme hörte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:854
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4acebe14:

    # DUPREY "Thank you all for coming..."
    DUPREY "Danke, dass ihr alle gekommen seid ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:855
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_14ad4098:

    # MC "(Hm? What's going on?)"
    MC "(Hm? Was ist los?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:856
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b6dd5166:

    # MC "(It sounds like it's coming from the training yard.)"
    MC "(Es klingt, als käme es vom Übungsplatz.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:867
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f159a15b:

    # "Peering around the corner, Captain Duprey stood alongside Borras as two figures joined them."
    "Als ich um die Ecke spähte, stand Captain Duprey neben Borras, während sich zwei Gestalten zu ihnen gesellten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:870
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_683fa502:

    # "The first, a beautiful, yet stern and cold looking blonde in a hooded robe."
    "Die erste, eine schöne, aber strenge und kalt wirkende Blondine in einem Kapuzengewand."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:871
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_39c09853:

    # "The other, a man of larger stature who I had not seen either."
    "Der andere, ein Mann von größerer Statur, den ich auch noch nie gesehen hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:873
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c3816f8a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Well, out with it."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Nun, raus damit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:874
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_829708c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Why did you ask us to meet here and not in my office?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Warum hast du uns gebeten, uns hier zu treffen und nicht in meinem Büro?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:875
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e5dab11:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "I'm freezing my tits off out here you know."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Ich frier mir hier draußen die Titten ab, weißt du."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:876
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5d90ff9:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "I could keep them warm for you if you wish."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Ich könnte sie dir wärmen, wenn du möchtest."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:878
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8cce2042:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Lay a hand on me and you will never {i}touch{/i} anything again."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Leg eine Hand an mich und du wirst nie wieder etwas {i}anfassen{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:879
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccb33939:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Feisty as always."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Temperamentvoll wie immer."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:880
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7d3baf97:

    # DUPREY "I'm sorry for summoning you both at such a late hour."
    DUPREY "Es tut mir leid, dass ich euch beide zu so später Stunde hergebeten habe."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:881
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_438696b5:

    # DUPREY "I couldn't risk the potential of spies listening in on what I had to say now."
    DUPREY "Ich konnte nicht riskieren, dass mögliche Spione mithören, was ich jetzt zu sagen hatte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:882
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_15a278d5:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "And out here is safer than my office how?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Und inwiefern ist es hier draußen sicherer als in meinem Büro?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:883
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ea753ae:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} I recently conducted a private search across the whole fortress with only my most trusted men."
    DUPREY "{i}*Seufz*{/i} Ich habe kürzlich eine private Durchsuchung der gesamten Festung durchgeführt, nur mit meinen vertrauenswürdigsten Männern."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:884
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_627d96fc:

    # DUPREY "I found echo crystals everywhere... including your office."
    DUPREY "Ich habe überall Echokristalle gefunden... auch in deinem Büro."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:885
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e306341:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You..."
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "Du..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:886
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2b146927:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Echo crystals?{/i}"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Echokristalle?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:887
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7cc2c81:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "That can't be right, I have my office checked, I-"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Das kann nicht sein, ich lasse mein Büro überprüfen, ich-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:888
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7233b5ac:

    # "Duprey nodded, holding up a small, glowing yellow crystal that he tossed to the robed blonde."
    "Duprey nickte und hielt einen kleinen, leuchtend gelben Kristall hoch, den er der Blonden in der Robe zuwarf."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:890
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b21cd245:

    # DUPREY "I'm afraid it's so."
    DUPREY "Ich fürchte, es ist so."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:891
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3e335085:

    # "The woman inspected the crystal and gritted her teeth in anger at it."
    "Die Frau untersuchte den Kristall und knirschte wütend mit den Zähnen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:892
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1faccc03:

    # DUPREY "It seems our great {i}'emperor'{/i} does not hold our loyalty in high regard."
    DUPREY "Es scheint, unser großer {i}'Kaiser'{/i} hält unsere Loyalität nicht in hohem Ansehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:893
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d6956b86:

    # "The larger man chuckled."
    "Der größere Mann kicherte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:894
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cac71787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "After everything that's happened, can you truly blame him?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Nach allem, was passiert ist, kannst du ihn wirklich beschuldigen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:895
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e7113e66:

    # "The blonde woman seemed more frustrated than the others, coiling her one hand into a tight fist."
    "Die blonde Frau schien frustrierter als die anderen und ballte ihre eine Hand zu einer festen Faust."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:896
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_897edc9c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Come now, this is all part of the game."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Komm schon, das ist alles Teil des Spiels."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:897
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_da595d25:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Yes, I... I am aware."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Ja, ich... ich bin mir dessen bewusst."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:898
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_aed55156:

    # DUPREY "The guards only patrol this area periodically, and it's the one place no echo crystals turned up during the search."
    DUPREY "Die Wachen patrouillieren dieses Gebiet nur periodisch, und es ist der einzige Ort, an dem bei der Suche keine Echokristalle auftauchten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:899
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cf9fe043:

    # DUPREY "I suppose they figured the chatter of grunts wasn't worth hearing."
    DUPREY "Ich nehme an, sie dachten, das Geplapper der Grunzer sei es nicht wert, gehört zu werden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:900
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4b3ecc3c:

    # DUPREY "Which is exactly why we're meeting here now."
    DUPREY "Was genau der Grund ist, warum wir uns jetzt hier treffen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:901
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97cd58fc:

    # "The larger man raised his brow."
    "Der größere Mann zog die Augenbraue hoch."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:902
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c4efb787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "That's all well and good... But why exactly is {i}he{/i} here?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Das ist ja alles schön und gut... Aber warum genau ist {i}er{/i} hier?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:903
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ecda2cd:

    # "The man pointed towards Borras, whose brow furrowed at the comment."
    "Der Mann zeigte auf Borras, der bei diesem Kommentar die Stirn runzelte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:904
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a377fbed:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "He's hardly fit to stand here with the rest of us."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "Er ist kaum geeignet, hier mit dem Rest von uns zu stehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:905
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_000b3a6c:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras will be replacing me for command of the Second Scouts Division, within a year or so."
    DUPREY "Offizier Borras wird mich innerhalb eines Jahres oder so als Kommandant der Zweiten Späherdivision ersetzen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:906
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ade1214e:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You're leaving?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "Du gehst?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:907
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2897e861:

    # DUPREY "My time is nearly up... I'm slowing down too much."
    DUPREY "Meine Zeit ist fast vorbei ... Ich werde zu langsam."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:908
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1d99c218:

    # "While the blonde seemed saddened to hear this, the larger man opened his palm upwards towards the sky."
    "Während die Blondine traurig darüber zu sein schien, drehte der größere Mann seine Handfläche nach oben in Richtung Himmel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:909
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c246e162:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I hope you didn't drag us out here to discuss your future retirement plans you old fuck."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Ich hoffe, du hast uns nicht hierhergeschleppt, um über deine zukünftigen Ruhestandspläne zu sprechen, du alter Sack."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:910
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dd633049:

    # DUPREY "Hmph..."
    DUPREY "Hmpf ..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:911
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_07d9c1a1:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras, hand them the reports."
    DUPREY "Offizier Borras, geben Sie ihnen die Berichte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:912
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_85fc15c1:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Yes Captain."
    BORRAS @ talk "Ja, Captain."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:914
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a550ea4e:

    # "Borras handed over a few sheets of paper towards the robed pair."
    "Borras händigte dem Roben tragenden Paar ein paar Blätter Papier aus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:915
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e077ed9f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "What's this?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Was ist das?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:916
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbb0024b:

    # DUPREY "A report that Alcott attempted to suppress."
    DUPREY "Ein Bericht, den Alcott zu unterdrücken versuchte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:917
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0873ff5f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "About?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Worüber?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:918
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dfb5dc62:

    # DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak has returned.{/i}"
    DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak ist zurückgekehrt.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:919
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dbf78d30:

    # "A great unease filled the air and I felt a shiver tingle it's way up my spine."
    "Eine große Unruhe erfüllte die Luft, und ich spürte einen Schauer, der mir den Rücken hinaufkribbelte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:920
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_506be64d:

    # "The name crawled and dragged its way horribly across my thoughts."
    "Der Name kroch und schleppte sich auf schreckliche Weise durch meine Gedanken."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:921
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_04766be0:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "There hasn't been a sighting in years."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Seit Jahren gab es keine Sichtung mehr."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:922
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ad6d35ce:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wasn't it reported that the beast was hunted down by the Inquisition?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wurde nicht berichtet, dass die Bestie von der Inquisition zur Strecke gebracht wurde?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:923
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbbee22b:

    # DUPREY "A lie told to ease panicking nobles."
    DUPREY "Eine Lüge, um panische Adlige zu beruhigen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:924
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_38a43a2d:

    # DUPREY "While it is true the beast has vanished for the last few years, this cannot be ignored."
    DUPREY "Auch wenn es stimmt, dass die Bestie in den letzten Jahren verschwunden war, kann dies nicht ignoriert werden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:925
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_78892759:

    # DUPREY "The beast's return... changes things."
    DUPREY "Die Rückkehr der Bestie... verändert die Dinge."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:926
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7a86413b:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "A specter, a boogeyman..."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Ein Gespenst, ein Butzemann..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:927
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a777b442:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "There are dozens of Demorai over the years that people have wrongly mistaken for being Zanarak."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Im Laufe der Jahre gab es Dutzende Demorai, die fälschlicherweise für Zanarak gehalten wurden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:928
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_086782c0:

    # "The man belligerently crossed his arms."
    "Der Mann verschränkte kampflustig die Arme."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:929
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ee8e9a7d:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...I'm not even convinced this Zanarak was real to begin with."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...Ich bin nicht einmal überzeugt, dass dieser Zanarak überhaupt real war."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:930
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ebb0762:

    # DUPREY "Oh... He's as real as you and I alright."
    DUPREY "Oh... Er ist so real wie du und ich, ganz sicher."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:931
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ba99ad23:

    # DUPREY "Make no mistake about that."
    DUPREY "Da gibt es keinen Zweifel."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:932
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6b72d9c8:

    # DUPREY "...And when he comes, all of us need to be prepared."
    DUPREY "...Und wenn er kommt, müssen wir alle vorbereitet sein."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:933
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2bce0fc0:

    # DUPREY "With, {i}or without{/i} the Emperors knowledge."
    DUPREY "Mit {i}oder ohne{/i} das Wissen des Kaisers."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:934
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3cdbebf1:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "What are you saying, Duprey?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Was meinst du, Duprey?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:935
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59e5864b:

    # DUPREY "I'm saying, Alcott can bury his head in the fucking sand and play politics all he wants to try and appease wet-fart nobles."
    DUPREY "Ich sage, Alcott kann seinen verdammten Kopf in den Sand stecken und politische Spielchen treiben, so viel er will, um die erbärmlichen Adligen zu besänftigen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:936
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_fcc3f2c9:

    # DUPREY "{i}But we need to be prepared for what's to come whether this knowledge is made public or not.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Aber wir müssen auf das vorbereitet sein, was kommt, ob dieses Wissen nun öffentlich wird oder nicht.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:937
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_18e7a24a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... You need to tread carefully with this."
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... Du musst damit vorsichtig sein."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:938
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_5b839082:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "How exactly did {i}you{/i} manage to get your hands on this report anyway?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wie genau hast {i}du{/i} es überhaupt geschafft, diesen Bericht in die Finger zu bekommen?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:939
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a2aca459:

    # BORRAS @ talk "By pure chance."
    BORRAS @ talk "Durch reinen Zufall."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:940
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a174e1ce:

    # "Borras stepped forward."
    "Borras trat vor."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:941
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_913c0dc3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "I was on a normal patrol through the Valley of Death when I stumbled upon a small, slaughtered convoy."
    BORRAS @ talk "Ich war auf einer normalen Patrouille durch das Tal des Todes, als ich auf einen kleinen, niedergemetzelten Konvoi stieß."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:942
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_787647a3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Amongst their dead was an Inquisitor, who with his dying breath handed me this report."
    BORRAS @ talk "Unter den Toten war ein Inquisitor, der mir mit seinem letzten Atemzug diesen Bericht übergab."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:943
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a7d9dd7a:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "The dying words of a delusional Inquisitor on death's door mean very little."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Die letzten Worte eines wahnhaften Inquisitors im Angesicht des Todes bedeuten wenig."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:944
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_46254da9:

    # BORRAS @ talk "There was other reports..."
    BORRAS @ talk "Es gab weitere Berichte..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:945
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f3335e6e:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "What?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Was?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:946
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_825a1215:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Suppressed as soon as they arrive, but more and more scant reports from our men on the fringes have reported seeing it."
    BORRAS @ talk "Sobald sie eintreffen, werden sie unterdrückt, aber immer mehr spärliche Berichte von unseren Männern in den Randgebieten berichten, es gesehen zu haben."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:947
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0d7eadc0:

    # "Both the woman and man were troubled the more they heard."
    "Sowohl die Frau als auch der Mann waren umso beunruhigter, je mehr sie hörten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:948
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f2428e23:

    # DUPREY "From now on, the three of us need to work closer together."
    DUPREY "Von nun an müssen wir drei enger zusammenarbeiten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:949
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a899d6c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "The city guard is barely holding on as it is, what exactly do you expect me to do?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Die Stadtwache hält sich ohnehin kaum noch, was genau erwartest du von mir zu tun?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:950
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b10a0545:

    # DUPREY "Whatever you have to do when the time comes."
    DUPREY "Was auch immer du tun musst, wenn die Zeit gekommen ist."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:951
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6afc1660:

    # "Duprey seemed to be working himself up into a feverish plea."
    "Duprey schien sich in ein fiebriges Flehen zu steigern."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:952
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_104f25e1:

    # DUPREY "These little camps everyone's set up is leaving us more divided than ever, it'll be the ruin of us all!"
    DUPREY "Diese kleinen Lager, die jeder errichtet hat, spalten uns mehr denn je, das wird unser aller Untergang sein!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:953
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2e21a987:

    # DUPREY "We need to unite and pledge to each other that when the time comes-"
    DUPREY "Wir müssen uns vereinen und einander versprechen, dass, wenn die Zeit kommt -"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:954
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59c8c819:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I promise you nothing, Duprey."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Ich verspreche dir nichts, Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:955
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e629b28d:

    # "The broad man's words cut through Duprey's like ice."
    "Die Worte des breiten Mannes schnitten wie Eis durch Dupreys."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:956
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b4c2c3b7:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...But I shall look into these reports myself."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...Aber ich werde mir diese Berichte selbst ansehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:957
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ebf4078c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "And depending on what I find, {i}perhaps{/i} there will be more to discuss."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Und je nachdem, was ich finde, gibt es {i}vielleicht{/i} mehr zu besprechen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:958
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e102cb4c:

    # "The broad man turned to leave, and as he did so, Captain Duprey looked towards the woman."
    "Der breite Mann wandte sich zum Gehen, und als er das tat, blickte Captain Duprey zu der Frau."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:959
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6ff2487b:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... I don't know, Duprey, this just maybe isn't the right time."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Ich weiß nicht, Duprey, dies ist vielleicht einfach nicht der richtige Zeitpunkt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:960
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ece5bef6:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "The more we unite our forces, the more we paint ourselves a target for the other factions."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "Je mehr wir unsere Kräfte vereinen, desto mehr machen wir uns zu einer Zielscheibe für die anderen Fraktionen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:961
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5cdc275:

    # DUPREY "... I don't care about the factions."
    DUPREY "...Mir sind die Fraktionen egal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:962
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_361df80b:

    # DUPREY "I don't care about the politics of the damn thing."
    DUPREY "Mir ist die verdammte Politik der Sache egal."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:963
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_538b8cf8:

    # DUPREY "What does any of that matter if there's no one left in the end?"
    DUPREY "Was zählt das alles, wenn am Ende niemand mehr übrig ist?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:964
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7e9daac:

    # DUPREY "Newheart is gone... There's no one left to save us but ourselves now."
    DUPREY "Newheart ist verschwunden... Es gibt jetzt niemanden mehr, der uns retten könnte, außer uns selbst."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:965
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e94a49a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Goodnight, Duprey."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Gute Nacht, Duprey."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:966
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2d5676a4:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "I hope you're wrong about all this... I really do."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "Ich hoffe, du irrst dich in all dem... das hoffe ich wirklich."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:967
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3bff260d:

    # "The woman turned to leave and join the broad man, leaving Captain Duprey to stand beside Officer Borras alone."
    "Die Frau drehte sich um, um zu gehen und sich dem breiten Mann anzuschließen, und ließ Captain Duprey allein neben Officer Borras stehen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:971
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_9b060e61:

    # "As the two figures passed me by, I hid myself behind a barrel and waited for them to be out of sight."
    "Als die beiden Gestalten an mir vorbeigingen, versteckte ich mich hinter einem Fass und wartete, bis sie außer Sicht waren."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:974
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d553e83d:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Captain..."
    BORRAS @ talk "Captain..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:975
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_eba06326:

    # DUPREY "Return to your quarters, Borras."
    DUPREY "Kehre in deine Unterkunft zurück, Borras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:976
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6fa2cda7:

    # DUPREY "Speak nothing of what has been said tonight."
    DUPREY "Sprich nicht über das, was heute Nacht gesagt wurde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:977
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f9c712a9:

    # BORRAS @ sad "But-"
    BORRAS @ sad "Aber-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:978
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_87e8ae86:

    # DUPREY "I'm tired Borras... So very tired."
    DUPREY "Ich bin müde, Borras... so unglaublich müde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:979
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ae2d5a5:

    # DUPREY "The next battle can wait for another day."
    DUPREY "Die nächste Schlacht kann auf einen anderen Tag warten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:982
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a5187100:

    # "Slowly, I watched as Captain Duprey slumped towards the barracks, likely back to his quarters."
    "Langsam beobachtete ich, wie Captain Duprey sich in Richtung der Kaserne schleppte, wahrscheinlich zurück zu seinen Quartieren."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:984
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e034c8e5:

    # MC "(Zanarak... Can it really be?)"
    MC "(Zanarak... Kann es wirklich sein?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:986
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97d93231:

    # "I shook my head, pushing the terrible thoughts away."
    "Ich schüttelte den Kopf und verdrängte die schrecklichen Gedanken."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:987
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d2897e6b:

    # MC "(I need to return to my bed, before someone sees me.)"
    MC "(Ich muss zurück in mein Bett, bevor mich jemand sieht.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:993
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97284131:

    # "As I laid down onto the bed, dark, terrible thoughts and dreams returned."
    "Als ich mich auf das Bett legte, kehrten dunkle, schreckliche Gedanken und Träume zurück."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:994
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af180033:

    # "Returned to torment me for the rest of the night."
    "Kehrten zurück, um mich für den Rest der Nacht zu quälen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1009
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_eb24fb27:

    # DUPREY "Alright maggots, today I will see whether you lot have made any progress or had you just wasted my time!"
    DUPREY "Also gut, Maden, heute werde ich sehen, ob ihr Haufen irgendwelche Fortschritte gemacht habt oder ob ihr nur meine Zeit vergeudet habt!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1010
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_884243ea:

    # DUPREY "We will start with duels first!"
    DUPREY "Wir beginnen zuerst mit den Duellen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1011
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_62189e19:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, grab yourself a healing vial, and fight as if your life depended on it!"
    DUPREY "Bildet Paare, schnappt euch ein Heiltrank und kämpft, als ob euer Leben davon abhinge!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1016
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_761342c6:

    # MC "Shit got real, huh?"
    MC "Jetzt ist es ernst, was?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1017
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_67044540:

    # "Markus was certainly not going to fool around this time."
    "Markus würde dieses Mal sicherlich nicht herumalbern."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1018
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_d92306b7:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Come on, [player_name!t], let's do this!"
    MARKUS @ angry "Komm schon, [player_name!t], lass uns das machen!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1019
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_bc95234e:

    # MC @ angry "Alright, bring it on then!"
    MC @ angry "Also gut, dann zeig, was du kannst!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1053
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_1263e952:

    # "Ouch."
    "Autsch."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1054
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_c58b41a1:

    # "Darkness."
    "Dunkelheit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1055
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8f6cd72d:

    # "Then, dim light telling shapes apart."
    "Dann, trübes Licht, das Formen erkennen lässt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1056
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_ce93bfa4:

    # "A vision."
    "Eine Vision."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1057
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_a05d37f2:

    # "A vision of Alderay under demonic onslaught."
    "Eine Vision von Alderay unter dämonischem Ansturm."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1058
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_f32b1941:

    # "Of me, defending it's people."
    "Von mir, wie ich seine Leute verteidige."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1059
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_27cd56c1:

    # "Uniting them under my banners."
    "Sie unter meinen Bannern vereinend."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1060
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_63b84b20:

    # "Power."
    "Macht."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1061
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_008f17f9:

    # "Wealth."
    "Reichtum."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1062
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d7eea514:

    # "Women..."
    "Frauen..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1063
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_b6ce6190:

    # "However, there is something else."
    "Allerdings gibt es da noch etwas anderes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1064
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8bf4ebd2:

    # "Something that drives me onwards, something from outside..."
    "Etwas, das mich antreibt, etwas von außen..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1065
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_90b93b6a:

    # "It's..."
    "Es ist..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1068
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d1df3db6:

    # "Ice-cold water!"
    "Eiskaltes Wasser!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1074
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_bc5c4518:

    # DUPREY "{b}ON YOUR FEET, MAGGOT!{/b}"
    DUPREY "{b}AUF DIE BEINE, MADE!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1075
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_5ad11caa:

    # "Captain Duprey's heavy kick quickly stood me up straight, recent knockout echoing in my head with an irritating, pulsing pain."
    "Captain Dupreys schwerer Tritt brachte mich schnell kerzengerade auf die Beine, der kürzliche Knockout hallte mit einem irritierenden, pulsierenden Schmerz in meinem Kopf wider."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1076
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_e7a57264:

    # DUPREY "Go again, Demorai won't wait for you to come back to your senses!"
    DUPREY "Noch einmal, Demorai wartet nicht, bis du wieder zu Sinnen kommst!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1077
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_032e9f26:

    # MC "(Gotta get a grip...)"
    MC "(Ich muss mich zusammenreißen...)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1078
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_523ecf6e:

    # DUPREY @ angry "I'm trying to be nice to you maggot, now go again!"
    DUPREY @ angry "Ich versuche, nett zu dir zu sein, du Made, jetzt nochmal!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1090
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6a4925e0:

    # MARKUS "Gah! You sure know how to make it hurt!"
    MARKUS "Gah! Du weißt wirklich, wie man es schmerzhaft macht!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1091
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fb6a986:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Someone’s had to knock some sense into you!"
    MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Jemand musste dir mal den Kopf zurechtrücken!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1092
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_66516ca5:

    # "As me and Markus caught our breath, I noticed an unusual figure dressed in fine fabrics speaking to the Captain."
    "Als Markus und ich wieder zu Atem kamen, bemerkte ich eine ungewöhnliche Gestalt in feinen Stoffen, die mit dem Kapitän sprach."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1093
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_163ee6d6:

    # "The Captain seemed unimpressed with whatever the man was saying and seemed to be refusing him something before being handed what seemed like a very official looking letter."
    "Der Kapitän schien unbeeindruckt von dem, was der Mann sagte, und schien ihm etwas zu verweigern, bevor ihm ein sehr offiziell aussehender Brief überreicht wurde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1094
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_783e0863:

    # "I thought I could make out the royal seal."
    "Ich glaubte, das königliche Siegel erkennen zu können."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1095
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_edb3c6df:

    # "I couldn’t hear what was being said, but I managed to figure out the words escaping his lips, {i}‘They’re not ready yet!’{/i}"
    "Ich konnte nicht hören, was gesagt wurde, aber es gelang mir, die Worte von seinen Lippen abzulesen, {i}‘Sie sind noch nicht bereit!’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1096
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7e66af39:

    # MARKUS "What’s going on?"
    MARKUS "Was ist los?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1097
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_28993885:

    # "I nudged him to look over towards Duprey."
    "Ich stupste ihn an, um in Richtung Duprey zu schauen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1098
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_78c93499:

    # MARKUS "... Is that someone from the palace?"
    MARKUS "... Ist das jemand vom Palast?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1099
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6da37e5e:

    # MC "I think so."
    MC "Ich glaube schon."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1100
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c390d19a:

    # MARKUS "Since when did the palace send its fancy officials down to us mud and grunts?"
    MARKUS "Seit wann schickt der Palast seine vornehmen Beamten zu uns in den Dreck und zu den einfachen Soldaten?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1101
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d52535a2:

    # MARKUS "What do you think they want? It must be serious."
    MARKUS "Was, glaubst du, wollen sie? Das muss etwas Ernstes sein."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1102
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_67965d23:

    # MC "I don’t know... but I don’t think it’s going to be anything good."
    MC "Ich weiß nicht... aber ich glaube nicht, dass es etwas Gutes sein wird."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1107
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_452c6b58:

    # "All of a sudden, the Captain heaved himself reluctantly onto the wooden platform and cried out for our attention."
    "Plötzlich hievte sich der Hauptmann widerwillig auf die hölzerne Plattform und rief laut um unsere Aufmerksamkeit."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1108
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4074b31d:

    # DUPREY "FORM RANKS!"
    DUPREY "ANTRETEN!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1110
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7bdc104e:

    # "The tired and weary Scouts hastily moved to form neat rows and face the Captain, hanging on his every word."
    "Die müden und erschöpften Späher formierten sich hastig zu ordentlichen Reihen, wandten sich dem Hauptmann zu und hingen an jedem seiner Worte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1111
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d0187a8e:

    # DUPREY "We have been ordered on early leave for a mission."
    DUPREY "Wir wurden vorzeitig für eine Mission abkommandiert."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1112
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_af5fac36:

    # "Confused mutterings swept through the ranks, as most of us expected the training to last for months."
    "Verwirrtes Gemurmel durchzog die Reihen, denn die meisten von uns hatten erwartet, dass das Training Monate dauern würde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1113
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_41c2d6b4:

    # DUPREY "SILENCE!!!"
    DUPREY "RUHE!!!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1114
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_219c5f53:

    # DUPREY "This order has come down from Emperor Alcott himself and has been approved by King Mesamor."
    DUPREY "Dieser Befehl kommt direkt von Kaiser Alcott selbst und wurde von König Mesamor genehmigt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1115
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b792546:

    # DUPREY "We leave come first light tomorrow."
    DUPREY "Wir brechen morgen bei Tagesanbruch auf."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1116
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fa47cd9:

    # DUPREY "Get to bed early, make sure you’re well fed and be absolutely certain that your equipment is clean and ready."
    DUPREY "Geht früh schlafen, esst gut und stellt sicher, dass eure Ausrüstung sauber und einsatzbereit ist."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1117
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cae6e8d4:

    # "A timid hand was raised from the crowd."
    "Eine schüchterne Hand hob sich aus der Menge."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1118
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c2e2d792:

    # DUPREY "What is it?"
    DUPREY "Was gibt es?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1120
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_13b24539:

    # RECRUIT "Where are we to be sent, sir?"
    RECRUIT "Wohin werden wir geschickt, Sir?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1121
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_544b0d7d:

    # DUPREY "The mission is top secret, all I can tell you is that you will be recovering relics from a lost fortress south of here."
    DUPREY "Die Mission ist streng geheim, ich kann euch nur sagen, dass ihr Relikte aus einer verlorenen Festung südlich von hier bergen werdet."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1122
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac7589b:

    # DUPREY "Expect at least six weeks march, take this into consideration with your prep."
    DUPREY "Rechnet mit mindestens sechs Wochen Marsch, berücksichtigt das bei euren Vorbereitungen."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1123
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Weggetreten!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1126
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cfa9b03:

    # "With that, the Captain stormed his way off stage, angrily shoving the sealed letter back into the fumbling hands of the palace official before stalking back to his quarters."
    "Daraufhin stürmte der Hauptmann von der Bühne, schob wütend den versiegelten Brief zurück in die fummelnden Hände des Palastbeamten, bevor er zurück in sein Quartier stapfte."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1127
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fa69c2ee:

    # "The men soon dissolved the ranks and the process of packing up for our departure began."
    "Bald lösten die Männer die Reihen auf und der Prozess des Packens für unsere Abreise begann."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1133
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_73d9be9c:

    # "There was much confused chatter about what this {i}‘secret mission’{/i} entailed, and more so the worry of now being confronted by the Demorai so clearly unprepared."
    "Es gab viel verwirrtes Geschwätz darüber, was diese {i}‚Geheimmission‘{/i} beinhaltete, und noch mehr die Sorge, nun so offensichtlich unvorbereitet mit den Demorai konfrontiert zu werden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1134
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d33077f7:

    # MARKUS "What the fuck was all that about?"
    MARKUS "Was zur Hölle sollte das alles?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1135
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_07f11245:

    # MC "I don’t know, looks like some higher up bullshit to me."
    MC "Keine Ahnung, sieht für mich nach irgendeinem Scheiß von oben aus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1136
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3e0ef9c5:

    # MC "Guess we'll be skipping the test then..."
    MC "Dann lassen wir den Test wohl aus..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1137
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_52b2a82f:

    # MARKUS "Hm... I’ll make sure to pack some extra bread for you, okay?"
    MARKUS "Hm... Ich werde dafür sorgen, dass ich etwas extra Brot für dich einpacke, okay?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1138
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f6d7e7b6:

    # MC "Where’d you get the extra rations from, you fancy fuck?"
    MC "Woher hast du die Extra-Rationen, du feiner Pinkel?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1139
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a1c732d3:

    # MARKUS "My brother sent it to me the other day, figured we could split it..."
    MARKUS "Mein Bruder hat es mir neulich geschickt, dachte, wir könnten es teilen..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1140
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ce4a9c8a:

    # MC "Oh, thank you."
    MC "Oh, danke."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1141
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7ff3445a:

    # MARKUS "In return I want some of that sweet wine you got!"
    MARKUS "Als Gegenleistung will ich etwas von dem süßen Wein, den du hast!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1142
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_95e59f81:

    # MC "What?!"
    MC "Was?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1143
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_282b2d00:

    # MARKUS "Hey! Don’t hold out on me! I know your dear sweet [regina_ref!t] brought you some!"
    MARKUS "Hey! Halte mich nicht hin! Ich weiß, deine liebe süße [regina_ref!t] hat dir welchen mitgebracht!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1144
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b5596df:

    # MC "Alright, alright, {i}we’ll share.{/i}"
    MC "In Ordnung, in Ordnung, {i}wir teilen.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1145
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_31c038e0:

    # MARKUS "That’s more like it!"
    MARKUS "So gefällt mir das!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1146
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbd1034e:

    # MARKUS "Didn’t want to have to bust your balls the whole trip if I die of dehydration because you wouldn’t spare {i}‘a single drop’{/i} for your dearest and oldest friend!"
    MARKUS "Wollte dich ja nicht die ganze Reise lang nerven, falls ich verdurste, weil du nicht mal {i}'einen einzigen Tropfen'{/i} für deinen liebsten und ältesten Freund übrig hast!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1147
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9f87cee2:

    # MC "But then how would I achieve my dream of becoming a drunk?"
    MC "Aber wie soll ich dann meinen Traum verwirklichen, ein Säufer zu werden?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1148
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_957e6607:

    # MARKUS "I have every confidence that you’ll find a way, no matter what."
    MARKUS "Ich bin absolut zuversichtlich, dass du einen Weg finden wirst, egal was kommt."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1150
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a370dbb4:

    # "Suddenly, the ginger haired girl strutted over to us, a coy little smile on her face."
    "Plötzlich stolzierte das rothaarige Mädchen zu uns herüber, ein schelmisches kleines Lächeln im Gesicht."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1151
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d469bfc4:

    # KIARA "Looks like I’ve been partnered up with you two for the march."
    KIARA "Sieht so aus, als wäre ich mit euch beiden für den Marsch eingeteilt worden."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1152
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cea643d:

    # MARKUS "Oh?"
    MARKUS "Oh?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1153
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5926d935:

    # KIARA @ happy "Aye, that won’t be a problem, will it?"
    KIARA @ happy "Aye, das wird kein Problem sein, oder?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1154
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f3de8e53:

    # MARKUS "After that little show you put on with the Captain when we first got here? It’ll be our pleasure."
    MARKUS "Nach der kleinen Vorstellung, die du mit dem Captain gegeben hast, als wir hier ankamen? Das wird uns ein Vergnügen sein."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1155
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4e8676e6:

    # MARKUS "I’ll be sure to let you soften the Demorai up before I get there!"
    MARKUS "Ich werde dich die Demorai auf jeden Fall weichklopfen lassen, bevor ich ankomme!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1156
translate de qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0739d47d:

    # KIARA "How {i}valiant{/i} of you."
    KIARA "Wie {i}tapfer{/i} von dir."

